# ─── Project-specific ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ─── Linter caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ruff cache
**/.ruff_cache/

# Criterion benchmark HTML reports
target/criterion/


# Swiss Ephemeris data files (large binary files, downloaded separately)
**/*.se1
**/*.eph
**/ephe/
**/ephemeris/

# Fuzz corpus / crash inputs (generated by cargo-fuzz at runtime)
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
crash-*
timeout-*
slow-*

# Profiling / benchmarking artefacts
**/*.prof
**/flamegraph.svg
**/perf.data
**/perf.data.old

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
